  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_9322.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El alumnado de 4&ordm; de Primaria del colegio P&iacute;o XII de Onda ha visitado la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes el Toll d&#39;Ascla, donde una monitora del Grup Au les ha explicado las diferentes especies de fauna y flora y han podido&nbsp;observar el &#39;toll&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9321.jpg\" alt=\"img_9321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9322.jpg\" alt=\"img_9322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9323.jpg\" alt=\"img_9323\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9324.jpg\" alt=\"img_9324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9325.jpg\" alt=\"img_9325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9326.jpg\" alt=\"img_9326\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9327.jpg\" alt=\"img_9327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9328.jpg\" alt=\"img_9328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/visitatollascla4artcolepiusxii/img_9329.jpg\" alt=\"img_9329\" style=\"max-width:100